  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Governance and Public Sector Efficiency Program (Subprogram 2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program aims to strengthen governance in the public sector and the diversification of the economy by introducing rule-based fiscal planning in the budget systems of the Government of Azerbaijan, reforming the legal and institutional structures of state-owned enterprises (SOEs), and helping improve the business environment and access to finance for small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs). This is the second of two subprograms included in the programmatic approach that was approved in November 2017.</narrative>
  </description>
